<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Mid-America Apt started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Mid-America Apt started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Morgan Stanley analyst Andrew Jones said he initiated coverage of Mid-America Apartment Communities Inc with an outperform rating.</p>
<p>-- shares fell 1/4 to 27-1/2. Set 12-month target of $31.</p>
<p>-- estimated funds from operations of $2.82 for 1997, and $3.05 for 1998, compared with $2.65 for 1996.</p>
</text>
